### Login Prime User to get token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "prime@demo.com",
  "password": "ShopSmart123!"
}

### Get Preferences (defaults)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Update Preferences
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/users/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categories": [2],
  "budgetMin": 500,
  "budgetMax": 1500
}

### Add to Wishlist (idempotent)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "LAP103"
}

### Add to Wishlist Again (idempotent check)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "LAP103"
}

### Add to Cart
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "LAP103",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Update Cart Quantity
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/cart/items/LAP103
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### Remove from Cart
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/cart/items/LAP103
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Add to Cart again for order
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "LAP104",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Place Order
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Get Orders
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Login Basic User
# @name basicLogin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "basic@demo.com",
  "password": "ShopSmart123!"
}

### Try to read prime user's order (should be 404 for security)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/ORD-000001
Authorization: Bearer {{basicLogin.response.body.token}}
